# fw_printenv / fw_setenv config for EcoFleet imx8mm-var-dart.
#
# These values MUST match the actual u-boot environment location: if they don't,
# every fw_setenv writes to the wrong place and slot-flips / OTA A-B rollback
# silently break. Verified on hardware (TRUCK-001, 2026-09-17): the u-boot env
# is a raw region at offset 0x700000 on the eMMC (/dev/mmcblk2), size 0x4000
# (16 KiB). This mirrors the config Variscite's own u-boot recipe ships — which
# is what actually reaches the rootfs today. This file is a kept-in-sync copy;
# it is intentionally NOT the shipped source of truth (do not wire it in without
# re-verifying the offset/size against the running device first).
#
# (Prior values 0x400000 / 0x20000 were wrong and would have broken fw_setenv
#  had this file ever shipped; corrected 2026-09-17.)
#
# Device        Offset      Env.Size
/dev/mmcblk2    0x700000    0x4000
